  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3304.09 Renewal of Third Party Agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3304.09 Renewal of Third Party Agency. On an annual basis, no later than 45 days prior to the expiration of agency approval pursuant to Saf-C 3304.06, the third party shall submit the following to the department:\n\n(a) A completed application and supporting documentation, pursuant to Saf-C 3304.02; and\n\n(b) A renewal fee of $1,000.00 to the department, pursuant to RSA 205-C:6.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3300.html"
